  unitName: Estia
  unitId: 850013
  unitNumber: 8021
  description: Princess of the ruined Elysian Kingdom. Estia lost her mother soon
    after she was born, and her father dedicated himself to military matters. The
    people around her were kind to her and always let her have her way, but she never
    had a true friend. This was until a young boy about the same age as her was introduced
    to her and made her pageboy.
  summonDesc: The only people I trust are<br>my father and Xenon.<br>You might be
    the third person.
  fusionDesc: What did you just give me?<br>It felt wonderful!<br>Do you have more?
